@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### List trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips

### Create trip
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Japan",
  "notes": "Summer trip"
}

### Invalid: blank title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### Invalid: unknown field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Japan",
  "titel": "typo"
}
### Get one trip (replace with the ID returned from Create trip)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}

### Missing trip: contract-shaped JSON 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
